            "text": "{\r\n\t\"type\"\t\t\t:\t\"ChalkTheme\",\r\n\r\n\t\"title\"\t\t\t:\t\"Chalkboard\",\r\n\t\"description\"\t:\t\"Chalkboard\",\r\n\t\"thumbnail\"\t\t:\t\"thumbnail.jpg\",\r\n\t\"!tag\"\t\t\t:\t\"Prototype\",\r\n\t\r\n\t\"colors\"\t\t:\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"background\"\t:\t\"black\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"group\"\t\t\t:\t\"rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"selected\"\t\t:\t\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\"assets\"\t\t:\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"text-chalkhand\":\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"file\"\t\t\t:\t\"/common/fonts/msdf/nanumbrushscript/NanumBrushScript-Regular.msdf\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"file\"\t\t\t:\t\"/common/fonts/msdf/permanentmarker/PermanentMarker-Regular.msdf\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"file\"\t\t\t:\t\"/common/fonts/msdf/fingerpaint/FingerPaint-Regular.msdf\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"position\"\t\t:\t[0,0,0],\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"rotation\"\t\t:\t[-90,0,0],\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"scale\"\t\t\t:\t0.07,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"side\"\t\t\t:\t\"FrontSide\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"color\"\t\t\t:\t\"white\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"align\"\t\t\t:\t\"left\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"valign\"\t\t:\t\"top\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"letterSpacing\"\t:\t0,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"lineHeight\"\t:\t44,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"text\"\t\t\t:\t\".\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"width\"\t\t\t:\t20,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"negate\"\t\t:\tfalse,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"align\"\t\t\t:\t\"center\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"valign\"\t\t:\t\"center\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"opacity\"\t\t:\t0.9,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"receiveShadow\"\t:\tfalse,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"extractInfo\"\t:\tfalse,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"castShadow\"\t:\tfalse,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"wireframe\"\t\t:\tfalse\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\"childr